<http://data.silknow.org/object/7d25d504-7e7f-381e-a1e8-31b2d27f2be7>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of woman's shoes, from Shache (Yarkund), ca. 1873"@en , "A Manchu shoe for women of lower ranks characterised by its thick boat-shaped convex sole which consists of a wooden frame upon which white cotton cloth is stretched, with its heel covered in red cotton. It has a light blue silk satin upper densely embroidered with floral and plant motifs in pink, beige and green silk threads which extends to its vamp whose edge is outlined with a leather-like material, and a heel band lined in light blue silk satin stitched onto the back of the shoe."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/e6af7288-f0c8-30dd-915c-ff90eef0a432> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b55f6d88-babb-3867-837e-70f8bf35b0f9> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "A Manchu shoe for women of lower ranks characterised by its thick boat-shaped convex sole which consists of a wooden frame upon which white cotton cloth is stretched, with its heel covered in red cotton. It has a light blue silk satin upper densely embroidered with floral and plant motifs in pink, beige and green silk threads which extends to its vamp whose edge is outlined with a leather-like material, and a heel band lined in light blue silk satin stitched onto the back of the shoe."@en , "Pair of woman's shoes, from Shache (Yarkund), ca. 1873"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7d25d504-7e7f-381e-a1e8-31b2d27f2be7/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7d25d504-7e7f-381e-a1e8-31b2d27f2be7/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7d25d504-7e7f-381e-a1e8-31b2d27f2be7/dimension/3> ;
